{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:A10-1","page_type":"section"},"citation":"A10-1","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A10-1","content_hash":"fce3788b73f3a9806ee7f5e4cf620cf1f61c69901b9f0651545bf60aea985f9b","heading":"Sec. A10-1. Jurisdiction of municipal court.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a10-1:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A10-1","text":"Editor’s Note: Sections A10-1 – A10-9 replaced K.S.A. 13-602 , which has since been repealed.\nThe municipal court shall have exclusive original jurisdiction to hear and determine all cases for offenses against the ordinances of the city; and to make such other orders as may be necessary for the conservation of the peace. (C.O. 11 § 2, 12-31-67.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"65a0e376-d4ea-5737-a09e-8f4d7325be9a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"A10-1","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A10-1","content_hash":"95daedc04a7b7832c6c9039c43b44a58e041ad32e3a92481c605836e515f3196","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a10-1:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:a10-1:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A10-1","text":"Editor’s Note: Sections A10-1 – A10-9 replaced K.S.A. 13-602 , which has since been repealed.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"c5dde9cb-d140-510c-a07a-11c4625b4390"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"A10-1","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/A10-1","content_hash":"b5b05595efb80d386fe153cdedf9ad07398d38c5e3bf7160a54c88f369cc481d","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_comp